  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Cut potato into bite-sized chunks.\n• Place potato on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, season with salt and toss to coat.\n• Roast until just tender, 15-20 minutes (it will finish roasting in step 5!). TIP: If your oven tray is crowded, divide the potato between two trays.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6614b636e677f43ae029a5bd-cf30a928.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, finely chop brown onion.\n• Grate carrot and zucchini.\n• Drain and rinse butter beans.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6614b636e677f43ae029a5bd-96c7ea89.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook onion, carrot and zucchini, stirring, until softened, 5-6 minutes.\n• Add garlic paste and cook until fragrant, 1 minute.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6614b636e677f43ae029a5bd-feacb233.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Stir in butter beans, All-American spice blend and BBQ sauce. Add passata and a splash of water and cook, stirring, until well combined.\n• Season to taste, reduce heat to medium and simmer until thickened, 3-4 minutes.\n• Remove pan from heat, then add baby spinach leaves, stirring, until just wilted, 1 minute.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6614b636e677f43ae029a5bd-13bf05b9.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Remove potato from oven. Sprinkle with Cheddar cheese.\n• Roast until potato is tender and cheese is melted, a further 5 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6614b636e677f43ae029a5bd-68827b35.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide smokey bean chilli between plates.\n• Top with cheesy roast potato.\n• Serve with light sour cream. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6614b636e677f43ae029a5bd-84fb0253.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
